### Data sources

The add-on queries OpenAlex, Crossref, Semantic Scholar, and arXiv. Their data is not
redistributed with this program and remains under the terms of each provider.

## services/paper-runtime

Not yet migrated. The source is ZoMiner's `paper_service`
(https://github.com/Leavvind/ZoMiner), Copyright (C) 2025–2026 Thehone1.

`paper_service` is original work distributed as a separate process that communicates
with the add-on over a versioned localhost HTTP contract, so it is not a derivative of
the AGPL-licensed add-on and its author is free to license it independently.

It is nevertheless released under AGPL-3.0-or-later along with the rest of this
repository, so that UniZero ships under a single, unambiguous license. Because this code
has one copyright holder, that choice can be revisited at any time — unlike the add-on's.

